    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Doran Estates are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom top-floor apartment at Mount Talbot, a well-established development in Clondalkin. Presented in excellent condition throughout, the property offers generous room proportions, plenty of natural light and impressive views from both the apartment and the development’s communal roof garden.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a particularly spacious living room with excellent natural light, and a fully fitted kitchen. There are two well-proportioned bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from its own en-suite, together with a separate main bathroom. A spacious private balcony provides an additional outdoor area and is an ideal spot to enjoy the views.\r\nOne of the standout features of Mount Talbot is its large communal roof garden. Available to residents, the roof garden enjoys panoramic views across the surrounding area, mature parkland and towards the Dublin Mountains in the distance.\r\nMount Talbot is a highly regarded development and enjoys an exceptionally convenient location. The Red Cow Luas stop and Park & Ride facility are approximately a five-minute walk away, providing a direct connection into Dublin city centre and beyond. The development is also ideally positioned for access to the N7, M50 and wider road network.\r\nA wide range of local amenities can be found nearby, including shops, schools, restaurants and other services, while Liffey Valley, The Square Tallaght and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre are all within easy reach by car.\r\nWith its top-floor position, spacious accommodation, private balcony, impressive views and excellent transport connections, this is a fantastic opportunity to rent a well-presented apartment in a convenient Dublin location.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
